                                                                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>3</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="14129353" author="dvryaboy" created="Wed, 10 Sep 2014 23:29:23 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;are we sure we want to do that bullet point 1? Seems  like it would cause a lot of thrashing peoples PRs and unnecessary friction.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14129357" author="dvryaboy" created="Wed, 10 Sep 2014 23:30:16 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;... in fact i think it&apos;s ok to augment the script to create a jira if a jira doesn&apos;t exist. automate friction away.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14130338" author="julienledem" created="Thu, 11 Sep 2014 17:29:15 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I did not have time to automate the jira creation if missing.&lt;br/&gt;
I&apos;d be happy to review and merge such a feature.&lt;br/&gt;
something like: there is no jira for this PR, would you want to create one?&lt;br/&gt;
and add it to the commit message.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14130356" author="dvryaboy" created="Thu, 11 Sep 2014 17:39:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;yea, we can have a separate jira for that.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But I don&apos;t like the idea of making it 100% necessary to have the prefix in the PR title.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14130372" author="julienledem" created="Thu, 11 Sep 2014 17:46:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;as long as The Jira prefix is in the commit message and the jira refers to the PR, I think it&apos;s fine.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14130431" author="dvryaboy" created="Thu, 11 Sep 2014 18:10:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;+1 to that&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17856987" author="rok" created="Sun, 23 Jun 2024 03:26:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This issue has been migrated to &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/parquet-java/issues/1431&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;issue #1431&lt;/a&gt; on GitHub. Please see the &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/PARQUET-2502&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;migration documentation&lt;/a&gt; for further details.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
